  <item>
    <title>Vol.11 为什么我们宁愿单身？单身不等于失败</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67de7d67dd11f9c8c159e2fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67de7d67dd11f9c8c159e2fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 26 Apr 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们围绕“母胎单身”话题展开讨论。民政部数据显示，我国单身人口在2024年达到3亿，这个曾被贴上"失败者"标签的群体，正在用“拒绝标签化认知、追求平等关系、保持自我成长”走出一条属于自己的路。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;母单原因之身边遇不到吸引我的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;期待恋爱，希望有个人多陪自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="284">04:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;谈恋爱当然要认真对待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">06:27</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;对母单没有刻板印象，但很讨厌被恶意揣测</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;逃不过的家长催找对象环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;不愿再想起的第一个相亲对象，对不起我看脸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;又呆又踩雷的第二个相亲对象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="828">13:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;单身的日子时有孤独，但不焦虑，实在不行多给自己找点事做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="996">16:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;为什么母单？通常有三点原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;喜欢平等的恋爱关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;在医院看见过生老病死后，突然觉得结婚非常重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">25:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;主播总结时间⏰母胎单身是现代社会多元价值观下的正常个人选择，应摒弃标签化思维，尊重每个人的选择与节奏</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>十八、小电波</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>椰果</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>24岁从没有谈过恋爱的小亚</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67975959c7fe8a3d4a1785d0/ljgufkoXriSFLk3GAavp4RgCoAqP.m4a" length="30474474" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmzNK1tn7TVAtUMMs6Byp4PgCEFw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.10 告别快餐式恋爱，拥抱慢热的幸福</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67de77a1dd11f9c8c15917d4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67de77a1dd11f9c8c15917d4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 19 Apr 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>快餐式恋爱是指现代社会中快速建立、缺乏深度情感投入且短暂终结的恋爱关系。在速食时代，快餐式恋爱成为一种普遍现象。但随着年岁增长，部分人逐渐看清短期关系与长期关系的本质差异，反思自我在恋爱中的沟通缺陷。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在快餐式恋爱盛行的时代，重拾慢节奏，用心构建亲密关系非常重要。本期节目我们共同探讨如何在感情里收获成长与幸福。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;回忆一件与初恋分手的导火索事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;分手后莫名其妙的前男友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;分手多年后突然要把我删了，你没事吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;长久的关系看重人品，短期关系看感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;酒吧邂逅心动男嘉宾，以为是真爱降临，其实只是想和我发生关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">28:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;朋友三人不同却又相同的暧昧结局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;年纪到了，更倾向于长期关系了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;结束一段关系后会感到难过，但不多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2008">33:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;反省时间之检讨恋爱时期的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;希望和另一半遇到问题时可以好好沟通解决</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2218">36:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;主播总结时间⏰快餐式恋爱易导致情感能力退化，当代人需重拾慢节奏的亲密关系构建。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>十八、小电波</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>椰果</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>恋爱经历丰富且“狗血”的小熊</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67975959c7fe8a3d4a1785d0/lvIAjSl4fv61L1qWCT5VZ1jlW5L5.m4a" length="40519291" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmzNK1tn7TVAtUMMs6Byp4PgCEFw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.09 算法推给你的婚恋观，是解药还是毒药？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67dbe1ef78103db3bdc1cd65</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67dbe1ef78103db3bdc1cd65</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>互联网时代，年轻人的婚恋观正在被重塑。网友的婚姻“劝退帖”让人更加谨慎，但父母的传统压力却依然存在。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目探讨互联网对婚恋观的影响：情侣博主的日常是否让你对理想关系产生滤镜？明星热搜是“吃瓜”还是隐形价值观的渗透？不婚主义与独立女性成为热议标签，你会受到它们的影响吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;情侣博主的日常会对自己的恋爱观有一些影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">07:08</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;会从网上有选择的看一些恋爱指导相关内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="553">09:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;明星的情感热搜？纯围观，对自己的观念影响不大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;不婚主义和独立女性都很常见，两者也不冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1107">18:27</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;网上其他人分享的婚姻经历让我对婚姻这件事更加慎重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;互联网让现在的人婚恋更加自由，但也面对父母的压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;和对象如果因为网上观念产生分歧，会积极去沟通处理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">24:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;互联网一定程度上会让人们倾向于快餐式恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;主播总结时间⏰互联网美化滤镜下的恋爱模板、不婚主义等多元思潮的加速传播正重塑着年轻人婚恋观，在互联网时代，我们都应该保持独立思考的能力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>十八、小电波</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>椰果</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>再次来到节目分享的“互联网原住民”小杨</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67975959c7fe8a3d4a1785d0/lsYiSqMo6PgzTMeQKm-MD-23UD6j.m4a" length="34317214" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmzNK1tn7TVAtUMMs6Byp4PgCEFw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.08 父母的婚姻，是我的爱情模板还是反面教材？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67dbdbd878103db3bdbfcf5b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67dbdbd878103db3bdbfcf5b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 05 Apr 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有人因父母融洽的相处而期待充满默契的婚姻，渴望伴侣拥有责任感与共情力；也有人因父亲酗酒、父母争吵的阴影，决心挣脱原生家庭的桎梏，在恋爱中摸索更直接的矛盾解决方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>潜移默化中我们都会复刻父母相处模式。在本期节目中，嘉宾分享原生家庭对自己恋爱观和生活的深刻影响。从因融洽家庭氛围对未来家的向往，到受父母相处模式左右的择偶标准，再到恋爱中努力“修正”父母相处模式中的“小问题”，探寻属于自己的幸福 。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;融洽的家庭氛围让我很向往未来的家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;受父母相处模式的影响，我希望对象懂我并且有责任感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">06:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;不算太好的原生家庭让我会有些不自信，但有在努力改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;不想找像爸爸一样抽烟酗酒的对象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;和对象在磨合中懂得如何解决矛盾，不像爸妈吵架时的含蓄解决</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1103">18:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;家庭一般的经济条件让我谈恋爱的时候比较节省</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1289">21:29</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;和对象的相处模式和自己爸妈比较像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1534">25:34</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;主播总结时间⏰原生家庭深刻影响着我们的婚恋观，这种影响如胎记般难以抹去。但通过自我觉察与后天努力，我们也许能够打破循环，拥有健康的亲密关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>十八、小电波</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>椰果</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>原生家庭很幸福的小杨</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67975959c7fe8a3d4a1785d0/lnGnK9ZBdvbnylAHghKLQPtZa-g4.m4a" length="29517295" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmzNK1tn7TVAtUMMs6Byp4PgCEFw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.07 异地恋的保鲜秘籍：如何在独立与依赖间找到平衡</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67dbd798dd11f9c8c1ef94d3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67dbd798dd11f9c8c1ef94d3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 29 Mar 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目邀请了一位经历了七年异地时光的嘉宾，高中时他们坦然面对"早恋"标签，大学后面对身边朋友“异地没有好结果”的质疑，他用实际行动证明距离不是问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>用定期见面制造仪式感，借自我提升打破现实阻碍。希望本期节目能够给正在经历异地恋的情侣们一些信心和方向！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> 从高中开始的七年恋爱，但不认为当时算“早恋”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> “早恋”给我带来的是正面影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a> 维持感情的方式：高中写信&amp;大学视频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a> 有因为异地想过放弃这段恋情，但确实太爱了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a> 异地恋最大的挑战：见面与信任问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 见面是解决异地恋矛盾的良药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> 面对家长的不同意与经济问题，努力提升自己来解决</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> 不太能接受婚后异地，实在要经历也会做到多见面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> 给异地恋情侣的经验与建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1389">23:09</a> 主播总结时间⏰当代年轻人的异地恋在独立与依赖间寻求平衡，重新定义了"亲密关系边界"。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>十八、小电波</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>椰果</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>拥有一段长达7年异地恋的萝卜头</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67975959c7fe8a3d4a1785d0/lmJKVUR9StJw2lJ2Sq9W5iCDLthB.m4a" length="29199522" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmzNK1tn7TVAtUMMs6Byp4PgCEFw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.06 生娃是人生的必修课？我的人生我做主</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cc548ae924d4525a33375f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cc548ae924d4525a33375f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Mar 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目聚焦"低生育率时代"下的年轻人的真实心声。低欲望生育时代，年轻人开始计算"生命成本"。</span></p><span></span><p><span>生育焦虑的来源从"经济账本"到"精力成本"，年轻人"不敢生养"的现实困境中，既有对生命敬畏的理性思考，也有突破传统的新型生育观碰撞。当"传宗接代"遇上"自我价值实现"，当传统婚育观遭遇城市化压力，这代年轻人不是在逃避生育，而是在用更审慎的态度重新定义生命的重量。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;关于生育率下跌，我有以下四点要说....</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;年轻人的态度：不想生，但也不绝对</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;生活工作稳定的话结婚生子算是顺其自然的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="553">09:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;生育早晚还是看自己具体情况决定吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;养孩子怪费精力的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;生孩子前有一些准备，具体还是边学边做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;养一个孩子的经济成本还可以接受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1231">20:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;有二胎的想法，家庭情况不允许</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">22:43</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;要对每一个生命负责，生孩子前多考虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;生孩子是一种新的体验，不生也有自己的道理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1666">27:46</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;主播总结时间⏰当代生育率下降是经济压力、女性意识觉醒与个体价值观转变共同作用的结果，社会需要构建多元化保障体系来尊重不同人生选择并应对人口结构变化</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>十八、小电波</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>椰果</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>儿子正在上一年级的34岁高中地理老师</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67975959c7fe8a3d4a1785d0/lgs7X95rJCJRReVldrXAzNHTygmh.m4a" length="33075999" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmzNK1tn7TVAtUMMs6Byp4PgCEFw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.05 网恋甜蜜开场 最后心碎收场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c178c2b0167b8db998b963</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c178c2b0167b8db998b963</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Mar 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>深夜emo时的心动匹配、隔着屏幕的早安晚安、转账记录里的不对等付出......面对网恋最终也要奔现的现实难题，我们该如何在虚拟与真实之间找到平衡？</span></p><p><span>本期节目用网恋者的亲历告诉你，网恋究竟是当代人爱情的乌托邦，还是隐形的情感陷阱？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">01:39</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;感情的萌芽也是最痛的经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;从性格特质找到心动网恋选手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">05:47</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;网恋容易，奔现就要考虑很多了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">07:34</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;网恋——更适合宅人的恋爱方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;给网恋走到最后的人竖大拇哥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;网恋好容易没有安全感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">12:24</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;被伤过后还是选择注重现实</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;家人：能成成，不成再说</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;门当户对很重要！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;令人心碎的不对等礼物</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;贴心的建议——不要靠近网恋啊！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;心碎网恋受害者希望大家铭记五个字——爱人先爱己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;主播总结时间⏰互联网时代恋爱的“选择悖论”</span></p><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>十八、小电波</span></p><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><p><span>椰果</span></p><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><p><span>拥有一段心碎网恋经历的天策</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67975959c7fe8a3d4a1785d0/lq4xZ34F2vHeoTew3yqv5h7FN62v.m4a" length="30856828" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmzNK1tn7TVAtUMMs6Byp4PgCEFw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.04 恋爱经济学：当代青年恋爱成本核算指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c17333bf52a16cd19df9ab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c17333bf52a16cd19df9ab</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 07 Mar 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>说起现在婚育率下降的原因，大家首先想到的就是“没钱”第二是“没时间”。成为情侣之后，约会过节处处需要花钱；情侣间走到谈婚论嫁的那一步，绕不开“彩礼”这个话题；新婚的夫妻想要有一个宝宝，首先考虑的就是有没有带孩子的精力和金钱💰</span></p><p><span>本期节目我们围绕“亲密关系成本”话题，带你解锁当代青年如何权衡恋爱中的感情、金钱和时间？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a>成本投入满满，感情＞金钱＞时间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a>逐渐清醒，不要因为沉没成本耽误分手决策</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">06:39</a>约会消费，双方有来有回</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">07:17</a>分手费？太离谱，还好我没碰见过</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a>惊喜礼物和自己喜欢的，我选后者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a>家庭原因，即使适龄也没被催婚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a>不是很想结婚，同居感觉好麻烦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="797">13:17</a>谈到结婚当然要重视经济条件啦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a>江西彩礼很高？北京不要彩礼？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1163">19:23</a>主观不想要孩子，但感情到了也说不准</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a>就算有了孩子，最重要的还得是自己啊！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a>跨越七岁的谈心时间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1743">29:03</a>主播总结时间⏰沉没成本不参与重大决策</span></p><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>十八、小电波</span></p><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><p><span>椰果</span></p><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><p><span>到了适婚年龄却还没结婚的29岁大龄女青年A子</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67975959c7fe8a3d4a1785d0/lhcYOuJwdNqeQFSaR0m3fdcLMrLN.m4a" length="33533865" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmzNK1tn7TVAtUMMs6Byp4PgCEFw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.03 从抗拒到接受：相亲就是多一个认识朋友的渠道</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bb14f505a90dfd0d4e2c02</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bb14f505a90dfd0d4e2c02</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Feb 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本节目从当代青年的相亲经历出发，揭秘相亲背后的婚恋态度变迁</span></p><p><span>本期节目邀请了一位拥有多段相亲经历的嘉宾。性格、三观、经济条件，哪个更重要？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;多段相亲经历拥有者——怎么大学就开始相亲了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;来自亲戚朋友介绍的相亲对象们，相亲网站就婉拒了哈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;安静舒适的相亲环境最佳</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;相亲对象竟然都是正常人，怎么和网上说的不一样</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;印象深刻的相亲经历——高颜值但大直男&amp;印象好但太忙碌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="499">08:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;性格人品三观都得看，相处舒服最重要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;经济条件和外在条件侧重哪个？我全都要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;相亲不一定直奔结婚，和恋爱也是有点区别的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="921">15:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;双方距离太远还是算了吧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;父母的意见对我来说十分重要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;恋爱结婚都期待，孩子这事儿顺其自然吧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;亲身经历相亲后对这件事的态度变化还挺大</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1596">26:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;主播总结时间⏰就算相亲也不能将就</span></p><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>十八、小电波</span></p><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><p><span>椰果</span></p><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><p><span>体制内工作并从大学开始就一直被介绍相亲对象的小葵姐姐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67975959c7fe8a3d4a1785d0/lnjzbYgqIAh5Jw6FedzexvWVisg3.m4a" length="31251051" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:12</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmzNK1tn7TVAtUMMs6Byp4PgCEFw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.02 cp嗑嗑嗑嗑不厌倦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b3357105a90dfd0d114a2a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b3357105a90dfd0d114a2a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Feb 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目带你用嗑cp解码当代青年的情感世界！</span></p><p><span>你是否曾在深夜为了一对CP的甜蜜互动而激动不已？</span></p><p><span>是否在追剧时，情不自禁地为他们的爱情故事欢呼雀跃？</span></p><p><span>本期节目带你走进当代青年的情感世界，解码"嗑CP"背后的心理密码！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;最近嗑的cp→为禹宙中欣举大旗（其实是前段时间）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;第一对真情实感的cp，有点意想不到</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;男男cp在嗑什么呀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;嗑cp没法避开同人文啊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;梦嗑一体机有话说</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">15:34</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;逃不过的内娱给我们上的第一课</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;莎头cp→茉莉芳糕名场面</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1373">22:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;源轩cp→张真源是宋亚轩唯一的主动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;喜欢嗑cp的原因？顺其自然罢了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">27:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;因为嗑cp向往恋爱vs只想嗑cp</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1970">32:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;情侣博主的视频再甜也记得看看就好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2366">39:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;主播总结时间⏰嗑cp是一种情感共鸣和情感投射</span></p><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>小电波、十八、椰果</span></p><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><p><span>椰果</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67975959c7fe8a3d4a1785d0/llDSlojzG_8Fd9_Vbp3F51gzmRWX.m4a" length="40904573" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:09</itunes:duration>
