  <item>
    <title>Vol.01 从开服到委托，乙游玩家择偶观大揭秘！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67af518405a90dfd0d840138</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67af518405a90dfd0d840138</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Feb 2025 14:39:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎来到本期节目！如果你对乙游满怀好奇，或者本身就是资深乙游爱好者，千万别错过！</span></p><p><span>在这里，我们将开启乙游爱好者与乙游好奇者的问答解惑时间，为你答疑解惑。偏爱做开服玩家的小锥，分享独特的开服体验；平平无奇爱双推的小女孩，讲述她的双推故事。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;乙游到底是什么？怎么玩？乙游爱好者尽力为好奇宝宝解惑中......</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;偏爱做开服玩家的小锥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;一个平平无奇爱双推的小女孩罢了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">15:16</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;氪多了，走不了了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;会买谷子，但也理智</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">21:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;有过一次还不错的委托体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1732">28:52</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;三次对象有乙游男主的特质是加分项</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1903">31:43</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;要找一个尊重自己喜爱的对象</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1966">32:46</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;有对象后和以前感受不同的乙游冷淡期</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2132">35:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;主播总结时间⏰当代青年的婚恋观使得女性会在乙游中寻求情感满足</span></p><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>小电波、十八、椰果</span></p><p><span>【剪辑后期】</span></p><p><span>椰果</span></p><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><p><span>从乙游开服就入坑，玩过很多乙游的小锥</span></p>]]></description>
